chidi (worried): But my degree is in surveying. Is that allowed?
quddus (talk): They want a degree in geospatial or a related field, so surveying fits well. Plus English proficiency and a strong academic record.
> 2705 | WHO CAN APPLY | 1f393 Geospatial or related degree | 1f4ac English proficiency | 1f30d All nationalities
